1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,715
Click a parcel, open Design, and choose Park.

2
00:00:04,067 --> 00:00:08,038
Open Edit geometry to add trees, flowerbeds, ponds

3
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:10,476
and paths directly on the map.

4
00:00:10,833 --> 00:00:14,188
Place trees and water, then draw a footpath

5
00:00:14,420 --> 00:00:15,570
through the park.

6
00:00:15,933 --> 00:00:18,824
Finish the path, then save the design to

7
00:00:18,894 --> 00:00:20,670
apply it on the map.

8
00:00:21,033 --> 00:00:24,249
Tilt, rotate and zoom to inspect the planting,

9
00:00:24,481 --> 00:00:26,559
paths and water in 3D.
